```
# 從頭再嚟
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:由最初嘅步驟或者狀態開始，重新做過；重新開始
eng:to start over; to start from scratch; to do it all over again
<eg>
yue:呢份計劃書寫到一塌糊塗，不如刪咗佢從頭再嚟啦。 (ni1 fan6 gai3 waak6 syu1 se2 dou3 jat1 taap3 wu4 tung4, bat1 jyu4 saam1 zo2 keoi5 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4 laa1.)
eng:This proposal is a complete mess, why don't we delete it and start over?

<eg>
yue:今次失敗咗唔緊要，最重要係識得從頭再嚟。 (gam1 ci3 sat1 baai6 zo2 m4 gan2 jiu3, zeoi3 zung6 jiu3 hai6 sik1 dak1 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4.)
eng:It doesn't matter if you fail this time, the most important thing is to know how to start over.
``` [end of text]


